WebCockpit map assets (ADR 0020)
================================

Files in this directory are fetched by the map worker only when the Map
pane is switched on. They are not part of the app's cold start.

arda.mm2
--------
The owner's MMapper map (MMapper schema v42), bundled as the default map
by owner decision (ADR 0020, 2026-09-28; confirmed 2026-09-29). The file
is read as is and never changed.

It contains MUME's room names, descriptions and other game data. That
material was created by the MUME community, and the copyright in each
zone belongs to the builders who made it (https://mume.org). MUME
publishes no licence for it.

  - WebCockpit's licence (GPL-2.0-or-later) does NOT cover this file.
  - WebCockpit grants no rights in it. For any use beyond what the law
    allows without permission, ask the copyright holders.
  - The MMapper authors claim no copyright in the map data either.

WebCockpit ships it on the same footing as MMapper, whose map
(https://github.com/MUME/arda) is distributed alongside its releases
with no licence and the same caveats.

pixmaps/
--------
The default tileset of MMapper 26.06.0, copied unmodified from
src/resources/pixmaps/ of the release source tree.

  MMapper: https://github.com/MUME/MMapper
  Copyright (C) The MMapper Authors
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any
  later version (GPL-2.0-or-later). WebCockpit is distributed under
  the same licence (ADR 0027).

tilesets/
---------
Alternative tilesets for the map (ADR 0082), chosen in Options -> Mapper.
Each folder holds files under MMapper's pixmap names and overrides
pixmaps/ file by file; a file a set lacks is taken from pixmaps/. Only
the files the renderer draws were copied, unmodified (no re-encoding:
Shimrod's files carry content-credential metadata, and a lossless
re-encode saved under 2 %). Only the chosen set is fetched, and only while the Map
pane is on.

WebCockpit's licence does NOT cover these tilesets (except the flow marks
noted below). They keep their author's terms, below.

tilesets/shimrod-{spring,summer,autumn,winter}/
  Shimrod's tileset for MUME mmapper, version 0.92, by Shimrod.
  Contact (from the set's README): cmdrhalvance@gmail.com

  Terms, from the set's README:
    "You may copy, use or edit the tiles in any other mod, just give
    credit."
    "Tiles may not be used in datasets for, in the development of, or as
    inputs to generative AI programs. They have been Glazed."

tilesets/desert/
  Desert, by Khazdul: Shimrod's tiles, modified, with Shimrod's
  agreement. Shimrod's terms above apply.

tilesets/gefe-rik/
  Gefe & Rik MMapper Tileset, version 0.1, by Octavia (octavia-mc), 2025:
  https://github.com/octavia-mc/gefe-rik-mmapper-tileset/releases/tag/v0.1
  The renderer's files from the release's pixmaps/, copied unmodified
  (its options/ folder, update0.png and terrain-deathtrap.png left out).
  Drawn for a white background; choosing it switches the map's
  background to white (ADR 0088).

  Credits, from the set's README: Gefe and Rik's maps, available from
  http://mume.kyrania.com/. Eolo is also credited on an older version of
  the Misty Mountains & Anduin Vale map.

  Licence (the set's LICENSE file):

