tilesets/grays-map/
  Gray's Map Tileset, version 1.1, by Sunnyl75, 2026:
  https://github.com/Sunnyl75/Gray-s-Map-Tileset/releases/tag/v1.1
  The renderer's files from the release's pixmaps.zip, copied unmodified
  (load-pony.png, mob-genericguild.png and terrain-deathtrap.png left
  out). Rapids draw the set's water tile. Drawn for a white background;
  choosing it switches the map's background to white (ADR 0088).

  Credits, from the set's README: a homage to "Gray's maps", made with
  Gray's Mapeditor. Gray made its first version; later versions and ports
  were by Morfizm, Dorien/White, Moonshade and Waba.

  Licence (the set's LICENSE.md):

    MIT License

    Copyright (c) 2026 Sunnyl75

