Flow marks in tilesets/gefe-rik/ and tilesets/grays-map/
  The stream-in-*.png and stream-out-*.png files in these two folders are
  not part of either release: neither set has flow marks. They are
  WebCockpit's own work, drawn by scripts/build-flow-chevrons.py, and are
  covered by WebCockpit's licence (GPL-2.0-or-later), not the sets' MIT
  terms.

